&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Looking to take the next step in your database engineering career?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Want to join one of &lt;em&gt;The Sunday Times Best Places to Work&lt;/em&gt;?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;AXS&lt;/strong&gt;, we&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Database Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help build and support the data platforms that power our products and services. You&#39;ll work with a range of modern database technologies, designing scalable solutions, improving performance, automating processes, and helping teams make the most of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity for someone who enjoys solving complex technical challenges and wants to work in a collaborative, cloud-focused environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database Design &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain relational and NoSQL databases including PostgreSQL, Oracle, SQL Server, Aurora and MongoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable, reliable database solutions that support business and product goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate database deployments into CI/CD pipelines for automated testing, migrations and releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage infrastructure as code using tools such as Terraform and CloudFormation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Reliability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise queries, indexes and database performance to improve efficiency and reduce costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support high availability, backup, replication and disaster recovery strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement monitoring, alerting and logging to maintain database health and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply security best practices, including encryption, access controls and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with developers, DevOps engineers and platform teams to deliver secure, reliable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex technical issues and carry out root cause analysis to prevent future problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as a Database Engineer or Database Administrator, including experience in a cloud-based environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of PostgreSQL, Oracle, SQL Server or Aurora, with deep expertise in at least one platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CI/CD tools such as GitHub Actions, Azure DevOps or Liquibase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Infrastructure as Code tools, including Terraform or CloudFormation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of AWS, with knowledge of Azure or GCP considered an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of database security, encryption and auditing practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Kafka environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent troubleshooting, analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related discipline, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pay range for this role: &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;£75,000.00 - £85,000.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited by the challenge of designing scalable data solutions, improving performance and building modern cloud-based database platforms, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today and help shape the future of live entertainment technology with AXS.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can find out more about life at AXS here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://aegeurope.com/brands/axs/&quot;&gt;https://aegeurope.com/brands/axs/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where&lt;/strong&gt;: This role is based in our London Head Office near London Bridge station. We work 3 days in the office (Tues-Thu) and 2 days from home (Monday and Friday). We also offer flexible start and end times and welcome flexible working conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So why apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Click here to find out why our employees love working for AEG&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://aegeurope.com/life-at-aeg/&quot;&gt;https://aegeurope.com/life-at-aeg/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AEG is an inclusive organisation where we value everybody’s contribution. We empower and trust our people to do the right thing. We go the extra mile, for our customers and each other, every time. We are always open to new ideas and respect all opinions. We support and bring out the best in each other. We really value our people and inspire them to be the best in class, always!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workforce. We believe in equality of opportunity for all and our approach to recruitment and selection is fair, open and based purely on merit. Applications from individuals are encouraged regardless of age, disability, sex, gender reassignment, sexual orientation, pregnancy and maternity, race, religion or belief and marriage and civil partnerships. If you require reasonable adjustments in any recruitment process with us, please make us aware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know that diverse teams make the strongest teams. That’s why we actively encourage people from all backgrounds, experiences and perspectives to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this role excites you but you’re wondering whether you meet every single requirement – don’t hold back. If you’ve got most of what we’re looking for and you’re passionate about what we do, we’d love to hear from you. You might be exactly who we need, in this role or another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because at AEG Europe, we believe that the best ideas come from the most inclusive teams – and we’re building a workplace where everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Analyst Working Student at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This role is all about driving impact: you’ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that push boundaries and redefine the grocery shopping experience. You’ll join a dynamic and collaborative team in a fast-paced, innovative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s&lt;/strong&gt; in a Quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for &lt;strong&gt;business consulting and data analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating&lt;strong&gt; complex analytical challenges&lt;/strong&gt; into clear strategies and executing business solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;SQL and Python&lt;/strong&gt; or excited to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in both verbal and written &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and have an&lt;strong&gt; EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt; available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;minimum 16h&lt;/strong&gt; per week for&lt;strong&gt; minimum 4 months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French speaker or good knowledge of the French market with a valid &lt;strong&gt;EU work permit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Depending on your performance, we can discuss further opportunities at Picnic!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will have the opportunity to develop your skills, not only through stimulating projects but also thanks to a dynamic, young, and international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧑‍🎓&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎&lt;strong&gt;Health and Transportation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Through our partnerships with Malakoff Humanis and OpenUp, you have the opportunity to enroll in our company health insurance plan, as well as free and easy access to professional psychologists, workshops, and practical tools. Additionally, if you commute to work using public transportation, we reimburse 50% of your subscription cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗&lt;strong&gt;Food&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Since we are located in the center of Paris, there is no on-site cafeteria. However, you will receive meal vouchers worth €11 per day to explore all the delicious restaurants nearby. Our small kitchen is also stocked with tasty snacks and refreshments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please submit your application in English or prepare an English CV.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
